      ],
      "orig": "As part of the formal examination (according to § 17a of the General Examination Terms of the Technische Universität Darmstadt, GET) the individual qualification was determined by the examination board of the Department of Computer Science in the subject-specific examination. The available competencies, regardless of the nature and origin of the first university degree, are assessed for qualitative and quantitative equivalent. The study regulations of the Master's program M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning (2023) of the Department of Computer Science at the Technischen Universität Darmstadt serves as basis (Ausführungsbestimmungen Anhang II: Kompetenzbeschreibungen).",
      "text": "As part of the formal examination (according to § 17a of the General Examination Terms of the Technische Universität Darmstadt, GET) the individual qualification was determined by the examination board of the Department of Computer Science in the subject-specific examination. The available competencies, regardless of the nature and origin of the first university degree, are assessed for qualitative and quantitative equivalent. The study regulations of the Master's program M.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning (2023) of the Department of Computer Science at the Technischen Universität Darmstadt serves as basis (Ausführungsbestimmungen Anhang II: Kompetenzbeschreibungen)."
